<style>
.card {
   background-color: rgb(29, 29, 29);
   padding: 40px;
   margin-left: 1.5%;
   margin-right: 1.5%;
   margin-top: 20px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: light){
  .card {
   background-color: rgb(219, 216, 216);
  }
}
.border{
     border: 2 solid;
	border-image: conic-gradient(from var(--angle), #01EFAC, #01CBAE, #2082A6, #524094, #562A83, #01EFAC) 1;
  animation: 10s rotate linear infinite;
}
@keyframes rotate {
	to {
		--angle: 360deg;
	}
}

@property --angle {
  syntax: '<angle>';
  initial-value: 0deg;
  inherits: false;
}


.Guide {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
}
</style>
<body>
  <div class="over"><div class="Guide">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="title"><b><i>Discord</i></b></p>
      <p class="title">I've made a discord, 06/8/2026</p>
      <p class="para">Join it <u><a href="https://discord.gg/YVxxn3pN3Y">here</a></u>.</p>
      <p class="para">Hiya! Nice to see you again, it's been a few months. The site is still here, strangely. First of all, regarding the discord, I don't expect it to be used often. That's okay, I'm just making it in case anyone wanted to request an update, or directly address a bug. I'll probably be mostly talking about my various changes the most, just like the wiki's discord.</p>
    </div></div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="title"><b><i>THS Gallery - Closure</i></b></p>
      <p class="title">I shut down the gallery, 19/4/2026</p>
      <p class="para">Sorry.</p>
      <p class="para">Hiya! Karis here, Square Enix sent me a DMCA notice for specifically the gallery. It's my first DMCA (let's hope it stays that way), so I just took the subdomain down immediately. I was also notified that <i>Accord's Library</i>, a previous archival site, had their gallery DMCA'd before the main site. That's scary, huh?<br><br> Anyway, nice to meet you.</p>
    </div></div>
    </div></div>

<p class="menu" id="backButton"><a data-astro-prefetch="load" href="/">Back</a></p>
  </body>
